      "value": "I believe that is due to a setting.  I don't know if it had been fixed since then or if just merely a matter of settings.\n\nSome of the things I have changed were changing the sound from 2D to 3D, and reducing another bar (I forgot the name of it, and I can't check at the moment) that I think was on the bottom, and reduced that to 0.  I tested with players in the HUB, and some sounds I have they can't hear passed a certain point (which is good) and others that I had different settings for, I can't hear at all, but they could",
